# This directory is a Linux container build context, and the repo is developed
# on Windows with core.autocrlf=true — which would hand `docker build` a
# CRLF-terminated entrypoint.sh and produce the single most confusing failure in
# containers: `exec /usr/local/bin/genie-entrypoint: no such file or directory`,
# because the kernel reads the shebang as `/bin/sh\r`.
#
# CI never sees it (Linux checkouts are LF either way). A developer building the
# image on their own machine does. Pin the working tree, not just the blob.
* text eol=lf
